# The ~194 MB voice corpus is served by GitHub Pages, not from here — see
# AUDIO_BASE in js/audio.js. Shipping it in the Vercel deployment too would
# double the payload for nothing and blow past the 100 MB static-upload cap on
# anything below a Pro plan.
audio/

# Build-time only. The venv is ~226 MB and the Piper voice model ~109 MB;
# neither is needed to serve a static page.
.venv-tts/
tools/
.work/
*.command

# Docs
SYNC.md
NEURAL-NARRATION.md

# The iPad wrapper (Xcode project, build output, .ipa copies) and Claude Code's
# scratch worktrees are NOT part of the site. They were being uploaded with every
# deploy (~565 MB of a ~585 MB deployment) and filled the free 10 GB
# Deployment Storage cap. The iPad app ships via Firebase OTA, not from here.
ios-app/
.claude/
.git/
